
---

### 2. .gitignore
这份配置涵盖了 Python 项目通用的忽略规则，同时特别包含了本地数据库文件和 IDE 配置文件的忽略。

```gitignore
# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# --- Virtual Environments ---
venv/
ENV/
env/
.venv/

# --- IDEs ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- OS Files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Project Specific ---
# 忽略本地数据库文件，防止覆盖测试数据
data/*.db
data/*.sqlite
data/*.sqlite3

# 忽略日志文件
*.log
logs/

# 忽略环境变量文件
.env
